     The ooppeennppaamm__sseett__ooppttiioonn() function sets the specified option in the con‐
     text of the currently executing service module.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     The ooppeennppaamm__sseett__ooppttiioonn() function returns one of the following values:

     [PAM_SUCCESS]       Success.

     [PAM_BUF_ERR]       Memory buffer error.

     [PAM_SYSTEM_ERR]    System error.

